---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    I'm an Industrial &amp; Management Engineering student at POSTECH, currently on leave after
    my sophomore year, practicing operations research on public data. I work through the full
    loop: frame the decision, formulate the model, test it against known benchmarks, and
    report what the numbers do and do not show.
  </p>
  <p>
    My first case study compares three formulations of capacitated facility location in HiGHS
    and shows how formulation strength changes solve behavior, including the case where the
    strongest formulation was not the fastest.
  </p>
  <h2>Skills</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Modeling:</strong> mixed-integer programming, formulation strengthening, big-M and capacity linking constraints.</li>
    <li><strong>Tooling:</strong> Python, HiGHS (highspy), reproducible experiment code on GitHub.</li>
    <li><strong>Practice:</strong> validating a model against published optima, reporting solver gaps and limits honestly.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
    · <a href={SITE.github}>GitHub</a>
    · <a href={SITE.linkedin}>LinkedIn</a>
  </p>
</Base>
